{"title":"1202.3775 Kernel-based Conditional Independence Test and Application in Causal Discovery","markdown":{"headingText":"1202.3775 Kernel-based Conditional Independence Test and Application in Causal Discovery","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Kun Zhang, Jonas Peters, Dominik Janzing, Bernhard Schölkopf（MPI Tübingen），2012-02-14，arXiv:1202.3775\n- **一句话定位**：提出基于核（kernel）的条件独立性检验 KCI-test（Kernel-based Conditional Independence test），在再生核希尔伯特空间（RKHS）中构造统计量并导出其在零假设下的渐近分布，从而对连续变量给出无需密度估计、无需分布假设的条件独立性（conditional independence, CI）检验。\n- **研究问题**：X⊥⊥Y|Z 的检验是基于约束的因果发现（如 PC 算法）的基石；连续变量情形下现有方法（条件密度估计、条件集离散化、局部置换/自助法 CIPERM）受维数诅咒影响，在条件集较大或样本不大时不可靠。\n- **模型与方法**：理论基础是两条 CI 刻画：引理 1（Fukumizu et al.）——使用特征核（characteristic kernel，如高斯核）时条件交叉协方差算子 Σ ẌY|Z = Σ ẌY − Σ ẌZ Σ⁻¹_ZZ Σ_ZY 为零 ⟺ X⊥⊥Y|Z；引理 2（Daudin 偏关联）——CI ⟺ 剥离 Z 后的残差函数空间中任意函数互不相关。实现上用核岭回归（kernel ridge regression）构造残差算子 R̃_Z = I − K̃_Z(K̃_Z+εI)⁻¹，得到\"条件化\"核矩阵 K̃_Ẍ|Z = R̃_Z K̃_Ẍ R̃_Z 与 K̃_Y|Z = R̃_Z K̃_Y R̃_Z，检验统计量 T_CI = (1/n)Tr(K̃_Ẍ|Z K̃_Y|Z)。超参数（K̃_Z 的核宽度与 ε）通过多输出高斯过程回归最大化边际似然选取。\n- **主要命题/定理**：定理 3：在 f(X)、g(Y)（f∈H_X, g∈H_Y）互不相关条件下，基于中心化核矩阵特征值的统计量 S_ij 之和渐近收敛于 ∑ λ ̊*_k z²_k（z²_k 为 i.i.d. χ²₁，λ ̊*_k 为某由谱决定的矩阵特征值），且结论对 L=n→∞ 成立。定理 4：X、Y 独立时 T_UI=(1/n)Tr(K̃_X K̃_Y) 与 ∑ λ_x,i λ_y,j z²_ij/(n²) 渐近同分布（与 HSIC 统计量相同但分布形式更易计算，HSIC 依赖四阶张量特征值）。命题 5（核心）：H0: X⊥⊥Y|Z 下 T_CI 渐近分布为 (1/n)∑ λ ̊_k z²_k，可用蒙特卡洛模拟零分布。命题 6：给出 Ť_UI、Ť_CI 在给定样本下的均值与方差，进而用两参数 Gamma 分布 Γ(k,θ)（矩匹配）近似零分布，避免特征值计算。实验：后非线性（post-nonlinear）机制生成数据，1000 次重复，n=200/400、条件维数 D=1–5，KCI 的第一类错误率贴近显著性水平 α=0.01/0.05，CIPERM 在 D≥3 时第二类错误率趋近 1；KCI 计算时间随 D 增长远慢于 CIPERM。因果发现应用：随机 DAG + GP 采样函数生成 100 个四变量数据集（n=100–700，α=0.01），PC+KCI 恢复正确 Markov 等价类的比例明显高于 PC+CIPERM 与偏相关版；Boston Housing 数据上 PC_KCI 找到 RM–MED、IND–NOX 等链接。线性高斯情形下偏相关的第二类错误更小（KCI 为通用性付出的代价）。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：把 HSIC 式核独立性检验推广到条件情形并给出解析的渐近零分布，成为基于约束的因果发现处理连续非线性数据的标准 CI 检验组件（附 MATLAB 代码），也是该团队后续把核方法嵌入因果发现流水线（如与函数因果模型方法互补）的关键工具。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"1202.3775.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title-